{
  "$comment": "ECPay public SANDBOX test vectors only (published by ECPay). Sources: developers.ecpay.com.tw/2902/ and /7424/ worked examples; github.com/ECPay/ECPay-API-Skill test-vectors/checkmacvalue.json and url-encode-comparison.json at commit 2e0bf816ef (2026-07-09). E-Ticket vector omitted (different formula).",
